      "anchor_id": "issue-gothrumedia-villume-backend-go-184",
      "display_title": "Issue #184: Add Text Wall Picture to Viewer JSON",
      "main_description_html": "<h2 dir=\"auto\">RESULT 03/08/26</h2>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">✅ Implementation: Add Text Wall Picture to Viewer JSON</h2>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Files Changed</h2>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">src/action/v1/exhibition/getExhibitionDetail.go</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">src/action/v1/exhibition/getViewerJSON.go</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">src/action/v1/exhibition/getViewerJSON_test.go</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Implementation Summary</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The viewer JSON text wall mapping now includes the existing <code class=\"notranslate\">text_wall.picture</code> column. This makes <code class=\"notranslate\">picture</code> available in <code class=\"notranslate\">exhibition.text_walls[]</code> for <code class=\"notranslate\">GET /v1/viewers/json/:sid</code> and any rebuild path that uses the same viewer payload builder.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Because <code class=\"notranslate\">GET /v1/viewers/json/:sid</code> can serve an older <code class=\"notranslate\">viewer.json</code> file from disk when <code class=\"notranslate\">json_version</code> has not changed, the endpoint now also detects stale text wall payloads that do not contain the <code class=\"notranslate\">picture</code> key and rebuilds them from DB.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Code Changes</h2>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Added <code class=\"notranslate\">picture</code> to the text wall response struct:</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-go notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"type textWallItem struct {\n\tID      interface{} `json:&quot;id&quot;`\n\tName    string      `json:&quot;name&quot;`\n\tContent string      `json:&quot;content&quot;`\n\tColor   string      `json:&quot;color&quot;`\n\tPicture *string     `json:&quot;picture&quot;`\n\t// existing fields continue here\n}\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-k\">type</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">textWallItem</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">struct</span> {\n\t<span class=\"pl-c1\">ID</span>      <span class=\"pl-k\">interface</span>{} <span class=\"pl-s\">`json:\"id\"`</span>\n\t<span class=\"pl-c1\">Name</span>    <span class=\"pl-smi\">string</span>      <span class=\"pl-s\">`json:\"name\"`</span>\n\t<span class=\"pl-c1\">Content</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">string</span>      <span class=\"pl-s\">`json:\"content\"`</span>\n\t<span class=\"pl-c1\">Color</span>   <span class=\"pl-smi\">string</span>      <span class=\"pl-s\">`json:\"color\"`</span>\n\t<span class=\"pl-c1\">Picture</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">*</span><span class=\"pl-smi\">string</span>     <span class=\"pl-s\">`json:\"picture\"`</span>\n\t<span class=\"pl-c\">// existing fields continue here</span>\n}</pre></div>\n<ol start=\"2\" dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Included <code class=\"notranslate\">picture</code> in the text wall query:</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-go notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"Select(strings.Join([]string{\n\t&quot;id&quot;,\n\t&quot;exhibition_id&quot;,\n\t&quot;name&quot;,\n\t&quot;content&quot;,\n\t&quot;color&quot;,\n\t&quot;picture&quot;,\n\t&quot;font_size&quot;,\n\t// existing columns continue here\n}, &quot;, &quot;))\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-s1\">Select</span>(<span class=\"pl-s1\">strings</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">Join</span>([]<span class=\"pl-smi\">string</span>{\n\t<span class=\"pl-s\">\"id\"</span>,\n\t<span class=\"pl-s\">\"exhibition_id\"</span>,\n\t<span class=\"pl-s\">\"name\"</span>,\n\t<span class=\"pl-s\">\"content\"</span>,\n\t<span class=\"pl-s\">\"color\"</span>,\n\t<span class=\"pl-s\">\"picture\"</span>,\n\t<span class=\"pl-s\">\"font_size\"</span>,\n\t<span class=\"pl-c\">// existing columns continue here</span>\n}, <span class=\"pl-s\">\", \"</span>))</pre></div>\n<ol start=\"3\" dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Mapped the model field into the response item:</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-go notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"resp = append(resp, textWallItem{\n\tID:      t.ID,\n\tName:    t.Name,\n\tContent: t.Content,\n\tColor:   t.Color,\n\tPicture: t.Picture,\n\t// existing fields continue here\n})\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-s1\">resp</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">append</span>(<span class=\"pl-s1\">resp</span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">textWallItem</span>{\n\t<span class=\"pl-s1\">ID</span>:      <span class=\"pl-s1\">t</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">ID</span>,\n\t<span class=\"pl-s1\">Name</span>:    <span class=\"pl-s1\">t</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">Name</span>,\n\t<span class=\"pl-s1\">Content</span>: <span class=\"pl-s1\">t</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">Content</span>,\n\t<span class=\"pl-s1\">Color</span>:   <span class=\"pl-s1\">t</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">Color</span>,\n\t<span class=\"pl-s1\">Picture</span>: <span class=\"pl-s1\">t</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">Picture</span>,\n\t<span class=\"pl-c\">// existing fields continue here</span>\n})</pre></div>\n<ol start=\"4\" dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Added stale viewer-file detection in <code class=\"notranslate\">GetViewerJSON</code>:</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-go notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"if (strings.TrimSpace(meta.JsonVersion) != &quot;&quot; &amp;&amp; meta.JsonVersion != oldVersion) || viewerNeedsTextWallPictureRebuild(viewer) {\n\tviewer, rawViewerB64, err = RebuildViewerPayload(meta, sid)\n\t// write rebuilt viewer.json and update Redis\n}\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-k\">if</span> (<span class=\"pl-s1\">strings</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">TrimSpace</span>(<span class=\"pl-s1\">meta</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">JsonVersion</span>) <span class=\"pl-c1\">!=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\">\"\"</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">&amp;&amp;</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">meta</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">JsonVersion</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">!=</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">oldVersion</span>) <span class=\"pl-c1\">||</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">viewerNeedsTextWallPictureRebuild</span>(<span class=\"pl-s1\">viewer</span>) {\n\t<span class=\"pl-s1\">viewer</span>, <span class=\"pl-s1\">rawViewerB64</span>, <span class=\"pl-s1\">err</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">RebuildViewerPayload</span>(<span class=\"pl-s1\">meta</span>, <span class=\"pl-s1\">sid</span>)\n\t<span class=\"pl-c\">// write rebuilt viewer.json and update Redis</span>\n}</pre></div>\n<ol start=\"5\" dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Added <code class=\"notranslate\">viewerNeedsTextWallPictureRebuild</code>:</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-go notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"func viewerNeedsTextWallPictureRebuild(viewer map[string]any) bool {\n\texhibition, ok := viewer[&quot;exhibition&quot;].(map[string]any)\n\tif !ok {\n\t\treturn false\n\t}\n\ttextWalls, ok := exhibition[&quot;text_walls&quot;].([]any)\n\tif !ok {\n\t\treturn false\n\t}\n\tfor _, textWall := range textWalls {\n\t\ttw, ok := textWall.(map[string]any)\n\t\tif !ok {\n\t\t\tcontinue\n\t\t}\n\t\tif _, ok := tw[&quot;picture&quot;]; !ok {\n\t\t\treturn true\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\treturn false\n}\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-k\">func</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">viewerNeedsTextWallPictureRebuild</span>(<span class=\"pl-s1\">viewer</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">map</span>[<span class=\"pl-smi\">string</span>]<span class=\"pl-smi\">any</span>) <span class=\"pl-smi\">bool</span> {\n\t<span class=\"pl-s1\">exhibition</span>, <span class=\"pl-s1\">ok</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">:=</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">viewer</span>[<span class=\"pl-s\">\"exhibition\"</span>].(<span class=\"pl-k\">map</span>[<span class=\"pl-smi\">string</span>]<span class=\"pl-smi\">any</span>)\n\t<span class=\"pl-k\">if</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">!</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">ok</span> {\n\t\t<span class=\"pl-k\">return</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">false</span>\n\t}\n\t<span class=\"pl-s1\">textWalls</span>, <span class=\"pl-s1\">ok</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">:=</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">exhibition</span>[<span class=\"pl-s\">\"text_walls\"</span>].([]<span class=\"pl-smi\">any</span>)\n\t<span class=\"pl-k\">if</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">!</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">ok</span> {\n\t\t<span class=\"pl-k\">return</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">false</span>\n\t}\n\t<span class=\"pl-k\">for</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">_</span>, <span class=\"pl-s1\">textWall</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">:=</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">range</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">textWalls</span> {\n\t\t<span class=\"pl-s1\">tw</span>, <span class=\"pl-s1\">ok</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">:=</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">textWall</span>.(<span class=\"pl-k\">map</span>[<span class=\"pl-smi\">string</span>]<span class=\"pl-smi\">any</span>)\n\t\t<span class=\"pl-k\">if</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">!</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">ok</span> {\n\t\t\t<span class=\"pl-k\">continue</span>\n\t\t}\n\t\t<span class=\"pl-k\">if</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">_</span>, <span class=\"pl-s1\">ok</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">:=</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">tw</span>[<span class=\"pl-s\">\"picture\"</span>]; <span class=\"pl-c1\">!</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">ok</span> {\n\t\t\t<span class=\"pl-k\">return</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">true</span>\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\t<span class=\"pl-k\">return</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">false</span>\n}</pre></div>\n<ol start=\"6\" dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Added unit coverage for stale and current payload detection:</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-go notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"func TestViewerNeedsTextWallPictureRebuild(t *testing.T)\nfunc TestViewerNeedsTextWallPictureRebuildAllowsNullPicture(t *testing.T)\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-k\">func</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">TestViewerNeedsTextWallPictureRebuild</span>(<span class=\"pl-s1\">t</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">*</span>testing.<span class=\"pl-smi\">T</span>)\n<span class=\"pl-k\">func</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">TestViewerNeedsTextWallPictureRebuildAllowsNullPicture</span>(<span class=\"pl-s1\">t</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">*</span>testing.<span class=\"pl-smi\">T</span>)</pre></div>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Behavior</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">GET /v1/viewers/json/:sid</code> now returns:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-json notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"{\n  &quot;exhibition&quot;: {\n    &quot;text_walls&quot;: [\n      {\n        &quot;id&quot;: &quot;...&quot;,\n        &quot;name&quot;: &quot;...&quot;,\n        &quot;content&quot;: &quot;...&quot;,\n        &quot;color&quot;: &quot;...&quot;,\n        &quot;picture&quot;: &quot;user/exhibition/textwall/file.png&quot;\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\"><pre class=\"notranslate\">{\n  <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"exhibition\"</span>: {\n    <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"text_walls\"</span>: [\n      {\n        <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"id\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>...<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n        <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"name\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>...<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n        <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"content\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>...<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n        <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"color\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>...<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n        <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"picture\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>user/exhibition/textwall/file.png<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">If a text wall has no stored picture, <code class=\"notranslate\">picture</code> is returned as <code class=\"notranslate\">null</code>. Existing disk files that were generated before this field existed are rebuilt automatically on the next viewer JSON request.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Verification</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Run:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-powershell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"gofmt -w src/action/v1/exhibition/getExhibitionDetail.go src/action/v1/exhibition/getViewerJSON.go src/action/v1/exhibition/getViewerJSON_test.go\ngo test ./src/action/v1/exhibition\"><pre class=\"notranslate\">gofmt <span class=\"pl-k\">-</span>w src<span class=\"pl-k\">/</span>action<span class=\"pl-k\">/</span>v1<span class=\"pl-k\">/</span>exhibition<span class=\"pl-k\">/</span>getExhibitionDetail.go src<span class=\"pl-k\">/</span>action<span class=\"pl-k\">/</span>v1<span class=\"pl-k\">/</span>exhibition<span class=\"pl-k\">/</span>getViewerJSON.go src<span class=\"pl-k\">/</span>action<span class=\"pl-k\">/</span>v1<span class=\"pl-k\">/</span>exhibition<span class=\"pl-k\">/</span>getViewerJSON_test.go\ngo test .<span class=\"pl-k\">/</span>src<span class=\"pl-k\">/</span>action<span class=\"pl-k\">/</span>v1<span class=\"pl-k\">/</span>exhibition</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Expected result:</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"ok  \tvillume-backend-go/src/action/v1/exhibition\"><pre lang=\"text\" class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">ok  \tvillume-backend-go/src/action/v1/exhibition\n</code></pre></div>\n<hr>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Overview</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Endpoint <code class=\"notranslate\">GET /v1/viewers/json/:sid</code> should include the <code class=\"notranslate\">picture</code> field for each text wall object in the viewer JSON payload. The field already exists in the <code class=\"notranslate\">text_wall</code> table and is used by text wall upload/save flows, but it was missing from the viewer response.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Problem</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The viewer JSON builder returned <code class=\"notranslate\">exhibition.text_walls</code> without <code class=\"notranslate\">picture</code>, so clients could not render text wall image assets from <code class=\"notranslate\">/v1/viewers/json/:sid</code>.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Root Cause</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The shared text wall response mapping did not include the <code class=\"notranslate\">picture</code> column:</p>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">fetchTextWallsByExhibitionID</code> did not select <code class=\"notranslate\">picture</code> from <code class=\"notranslate\">text_wall</code>.</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">textWallItem</code> did not define a <code class=\"notranslate\">picture</code> JSON field.</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">mapTextWallsToResponse</code> did not copy <code class=\"notranslate\">models.TextWall.Picture</code> into the response.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Implementation</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Updated <code class=\"notranslate\">src/action/v1/exhibition/getExhibitionDetail.go</code> to:</p>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Add <code class=\"notranslate\">Picture *string</code> to <code class=\"notranslate\">textWallItem</code> with JSON key <code class=\"notranslate\">picture</code>.</li>\n<li>Include <code class=\"notranslate\">picture</code> in the <code class=\"notranslate\">text_wall</code> select list.</li>\n<li>Map <code class=\"notranslate\">t.Picture</code> into each text wall response item.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Scope</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">In scope:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">GET /v1/viewers/json/:sid</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">exhibition.text_walls[].picture</code> in viewer JSON rebuild/response flow</li>\n<li>Existing text wall DB field <code class=\"notranslate\">text_wall.picture</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Out of scope:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Text wall upload behavior</li>\n<li>Database schema changes</li>\n<li>Route changes</li>\n<li>Response changes outside text wall objects</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Acceptance Criteria</h2>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">GET /v1/viewers/json/:sid</code> includes <code class=\"notranslate\">picture</code> for each item in <code class=\"notranslate\">exhibition.text_walls</code>.</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">picture</code> is <code class=\"notranslate\">null</code> when no picture is stored.</li>\n<li>Existing text wall fields remain unchanged.</li>\n<li>Code is formatted with <code class=\"notranslate\">gofmt</code>.</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">go test ./src/action/v1/exhibition</code> passes.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Verification</h2>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">gofmt -w src/action/v1/exhibition/getExhibitionDetail.go</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">go test ./src/action/v1/exhibition</code></li>\n</ul>",
